ually-supervised research training of the highest standard. Renowned scientists supervise your research and help you develop into a fully-fledged scientist ready to succeed in academia or elsewhere. After finishing our PhD programme you will have a broad skillset and an internationally appreciated PhD degree.\nThe GSSE community is culturally highly diverse: Around 75% of our ~1,300 PhD candidates come from outside of the Netherlands. While our official working language is English, it is possible to hear multiple different languages on the campus on a daily basis.\nLast modified:23 March 2026 1.04 p.m.\nFollow the UG\nFacebook Page University of Groningen\nLinkedIn Page University of Groningen\nRSS-feed University of Groningen\nInstagram account University of Groningen\nYouTube channel University of Groningen\nProspective students\nProspective students\nProspective students\nInformation events for prospective students\nBachelor's degree programmes\nMaster's degree programmes\nScholierenacademie\nSummer Schools\nHonours College\nPhD programmes\nFrequently asked questions\nSociety/Business\nSociety/Business\nSociety/Business\nUniversity of Groningen Library\nFind an expert\nLanguage Centre\nCollaborating with the UG\nCenter for Information Technology\nUniversity Museum\nCareer Services\nStudium Generale\nSchools for Science & Society\nAlumni\nAlumni\nAlumni\nAlumni Activities\nMagazine Broerstraat 5\nUpdate your information\nSupport research and education\nAbout us\nAbout us\nAbout us\nHow to find us\nJob opportunities\nFaculty of Economics and Business\nFaculty of Behavioural and Social Sciences\nFaculty of Religion, Culture and Society\nFaculty of Arts\nFaculty of Medical Sciences\nFaculty of Law\nFaculty of Spatial Sciences\nFaculty of Philosophy\nFaculty of Science and Engineering\nUniversity College Groningen\nCampus Frysl\u00e2n\nUniversity Services\nFacility Management\nCorporate Communication\nCalendar\nDisclaimer & Copyright Privacy Cookies Login\nEssential\n